  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\nどうした、咲耶？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、いや\r\nすまない、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "少しね",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何かいいことでもあったか？\r\nなかなかご機嫌に見える",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あった、といえばあったし──\r\n続いている、といった方がいい気もする",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "加えて、これはもちろん\r\nただ『いいこと』だけの話でもない",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……？\r\n難しいな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なぞなぞか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや\r\nずいぶん可愛らしいことを言うんだね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006004060150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……なんてことはない\r\nここで確認するまでもないような、当たり前の話だよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600406/1006004060150"
  },
  {
